    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "p0",
        "title": "Press Safe, Confirm Big",
        "text": "Strong pressure uses cheap, low-commitment A and B normals - they are hard to punish even when Recoil Guarded. The damage comes later: only when you SEE the hit connect do you commit to the expensive part of the combo."
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "title": "The Decision",
        "text": "That moment of recognition is the hit confirm. On HIT you continue into the full route; on BLOCK you stop before the unsafe commitment. Stopping avoids handing over a free punish - it does not automatically guarantee that your turn continues."
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "title": "The Drill",
        "text": "Five rounds. Each time, poke with {input:5A} > {input:5B} - the dummy randomly blocks or gets hit. Finish the combo ONLY on hit; hold your ground on block. Guessing is losing: react to what you see."
      }
    ],
